<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Environment — local_LLM docs</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="docs.css">
<style>
  main.wide { max-width: 1040px; }

  .lede-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .lede-row .tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ---- section labels ---- */

  .section-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .section-label::after {
    content: "";
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
  }

  /* ---- flow diagram ---- */

  .flow { margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }

  .node-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .node {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .node .name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .node .detail {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .entry-node .detail { color: var(--text-muted); }

  .connector {
    width: 1px;
    height: 2rem;
    background: var(--line-strong);
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
  }

  .connector::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    border-left: 5px solid transparent;
    border-right: 5px solid transparent;
    border-top: 6px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .caddy-node {
    border-color: var(--zone-danger);
    border-width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--zone-danger-soft), var(--surface) 60%);
    padding: 1.1rem 2rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .caddy-node .name {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--zone-danger);
  }

  .caddy-node .detail {
    color: var(--text);
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .caddy-node .ports {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .bus-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .bus-stem {
    width: 1px;
    height: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--line-strong);
  }

  .bus-line {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .service-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .group-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1rem 1rem;
  }

  .group-box::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -1.5rem;
    left: 50%;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--line-strong);
  }

  .group-label {
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.6rem;
    left: 0.9rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    padding: 0 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .group-llm .group-label { color: var(--zone-services); }
  .group-obs .group-label { color: var(--zone-monitor); }
  .group-back .group-label { color: var(--zone-back); }

  .group-back {
    border-style: solid;
    border-color: var(--zone-back);
    padding: 1.4rem 0.9rem 0.9rem;
  }

  .group-back::before { content: none; }

  .group-cards {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .obs-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0;
    width: 380px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .group-llm { flex-shrink: 0; }

  .obs-column .group-box { width: 100%; }

  .obs-connector {
    width: 1px;
    height: 1.4rem;
    background: var(--line-strong);
    align-self: center;
  }

  .back-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--zone-back);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem 0.7rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    min-width: 108px;
  }

  .back-card .name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .back-card .port {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }

  .service-card {
    flex: 1 1 150px;
    max-width: 190px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--zone-services);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.9rem 0.9rem 1rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .service-card .name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .service-card .role {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .service-card .port {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--zone-services);
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .service-card.front .port { color: var(--accent); }
  .service-card.front { border-top-color: var(--accent); }

  .front-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.08rem 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .monitor-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--zone-monitor);
    background: var(--zone-monitor-soft);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.08rem 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .service-card.monitor { border-top-color: var(--zone-monitor); }
  .service-card.monitor .port { color: var(--zone-monitor); }

  /* ---- lower panels ---- */

  .panels {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .panels { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .panel {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .panel h2 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
  }

  .panel .panel-sub {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }

  .call-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }

  .call {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .call .who {
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .call .arrow {
    color: var(--zone-services);
    font-family: var(--mono);
  }

  .call .why {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .scrape-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .scrape {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .scrape .src {
    color: var(--zone-monitor);
    min-width: 8.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .scrape .note {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .exception-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-top: 0.9rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .exception-note strong { color: var(--text); }

  /* ---- legend ---- */

  .legend {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .legend .item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .diagram-note {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
  }

  .diagram-note code {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    padding: 0.03rem 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .swatch {
    width: 0.7rem;
    height: 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .swatch.caddy { background: var(--zone-danger); }
  .swatch.svc { background: var(--zone-services); }
  .swatch.mon { background: var(--zone-monitor); }
  .swatch.back { background: var(--zone-back); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<aside class="sidebar">
  <div class="brand">local_LLM</div>
  <div class="brand-sub">docs</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="api.html">API</a>
    <a href="environment.html" class="active">Environment</a>
    <a href="hardware.html">Hardware</a>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <a href="https://github.com/JEA666/local_LLM.git" class="external" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Repo</a>
  </nav>
</aside>

<main class="wide">
  <div class="lede-row">
    <div>
      <h1 style="margin-bottom:0.2rem">Environment</h1>
      <div class="lede" style="margin:0">local_LLM stack · DOMAIN_PLACEHOLDER</div>
    </div>
    <span class="tag">docker compose · single host</span>
  </div>

  <div class="flow">
    <p class="section-label">Incoming traffic</p>

    <div class="node-row">
      <div class="node entry-node">
        <div class="name">Internet / LAN</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="connector"></div>

    <div class="node-row">
      <div class="node caddy-node">
        <div class="name">Caddy</div>
        <div class="detail">TLS termination</div>
        <div class="ports">:443 · :3000</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bus-wrap">
      <div class="bus-stem"></div>
      <div class="bus-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-row">
      <div class="group-box group-llm">
        <span class="group-label">LLM stack</span>
        <div class="group-cards">
          <div class="service-card front">
            <span class="front-tag">portal</span>
            <div class="name">Dashy</div>
            <div class="port">/</div>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="name">OpenWebUI</div>
            <div class="role">Chat</div>
            <div class="port">:3000</div>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="name">SearXNG</div>
            <div class="role">Search</div>
            <div class="port">/search</div>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="name">llm-server</div>
            <div class="role">Inference (GPU)</div>
            <div class="port">/llm</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="obs-column">
        <div class="group-box group-obs">
          <span class="group-label">Obs stack</span>
          <div class="group-cards">
            <div class="service-card monitor">
              <span class="monitor-tag">optional</span>
              <div class="name">Grafana</div>
              <div class="port">/obs</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="obs-connector"></div>

        <div class="group-box group-back">
          <span class="group-label">Back end</span>
          <div class="group-cards">
            <div class="back-card">
              <div class="name">prometheus</div>
              <div class="port">:9090</div>
            </div>
            <div class="back-card">
              <div class="name">node-exporter</div>
              <div class="port">host:9100</div>
            </div>
            <div class="back-card">
              <div class="name">cadvisor</div>
              <div class="port">:8080</div>
            </div>
            <div class="back-card">
              <div class="name">gpu-exporter</div>
              <div class="port">:9835</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="legend">
      <div class="item"><span class="swatch caddy"></span> Caddy (exposed)</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="swatch svc"></span> LLM stack</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="swatch mon"></span> Obs stack (optional)</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="swatch back"></span> Back end</div>
    </div>
    <p class="diagram-note">Path-routed under Caddy's single <code>:443</code>, except OpenWebUI (own port -- no subpath support in its SvelteKit build). Back end services never go through Caddy either way -- prometheus/cadvisor/gpu-exporter are internal-only (no published port), but node-exporter runs on the host's own network (<code>network_mode: host</code>) for accurate host-level stats, so it's reachable directly on the host, not internal-only like the other three.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="section-label">Internal, independent of Caddy</p>

  <div class="panels">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Service-to-service</h2>
      <p class="panel-sub"><code>local-llm-net</code>, never via Caddy</p>
      <div class="call-list">
        <div class="call">
          <span class="who">OpenWebUI</span>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
          <span class="who">llm-server</span>
          <span class="why">inference</span>
        </div>
        <div class="call">
          <span class="who">OpenWebUI</span>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
          <span class="who">SearXNG</span>
          <span class="why">web search</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="exception-note">
        Only Caddy publishes ports to the host.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Monitoring stack</h2>
      <p class="panel-sub"><code>compose.monitoring.yml</code></p>
      <div class="scrape-list">
        <div class="scrape"><span class="src">prometheus</span><span class="note">scrapes the five below</span></div>
        <div class="scrape"><span class="src">↳ llm-server</span><span class="note">token throughput</span></div>
        <div class="scrape"><span class="src">↳ caddy</span><span class="note">response times</span></div>
        <div class="scrape"><span class="src">↳ node-exporter</span><span class="note">CPU/memory/disk</span></div>
        <div class="scrape"><span class="src">↳ cadvisor</span><span class="note">per-container</span></div>
        <div class="scrape"><span class="src">↳ gpu-exporter</span><span class="note">GPU util/VRAM/power</span></div>
        <div class="scrape"><span class="src">grafana</span><span class="note">queries prometheus</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="exception-note">
        <strong>cadvisor</strong>: only exception to "no docker.sock", read-only.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
